# B0 (no card opened): build the window image tp4-sdpa-multi-1 from the pushed tp4/sdpa-multi commit. The profile named is the production default; nothing is baked as the image default
# (no C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE), so the image default stays qwen_c2_profiles.json's c2-packed-tp4. THE TAG MUST BE FRESH: the build step skips a tag that already exists.
# THE 262k EVIDENCE WAIVER: the 262k evidence records are pending skeletons, so the gate-only arms carry QWEN_FAST_262K_EVIDENCE_WAIVER=1 (a gate run of a gate-only profile only): every result of this window is
# UNQUALIFIED, a measurement and never evidence. THE IMAGE MUST CARRY THE MULTI FILES: sdpa_multi_tp.py and its three JIT kernels (sdpa_multi_mask_tp.cpp, sdpa_multi_gather_tp.cpp, sdpa_multi_audit_tp.cpp) are in
# the Dockerfile COPY list, the image workflow's copy loop and the C2 overlay (test_sdpa_multi_tp ShipmentTests holds all three), and the provenance report must list them: a file in none of the lists ships at the bundle version, which has no such file.
# No privileged builder container may be up. READ: the build log's provenance report with no problem line, the closure checks pass, the image id printed. Never run it during a timing job. Duration (estimate): 20-60 min. Stop rule: a build or provenance failure stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/sdpa-multi eight-seat 262k development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/sdpa-multi and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-sdpa-multi-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/sdpa-multi commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-sdpa-multi-2
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
